\ Exercises method{ on a user-defined virtual type under runtime-image
\ AOT. The dispatch entry is registered at freeze time keyed on the
\ shape TypeValue's descriptor; the runtime push of that TypeValue
\ goes through the slot table. The registered method replays into the
\ runtime dispatch table and the generic call site dispatches to it, so
\ `double` runs the method rather than the generic fallback.

shape: virtual{ fixnum } ;

double: generic ( s -- n ) [ drop 0 ] ;
double: method{ shape } [ unmake-shape 2 * ] ;

5 make-shape double .
10 >shape double .
